The [[Carrot Goobert]] is a [[Pet]] normally obtainable by combining a [[Goobert]] with two [[Carrot]]s, making it a [[Ranger]]-exclusive. Unlike most other [[Gooberts]], it doesn't directly heal in any way, instead cleansing debuffs and giving temporary {{icon/empower}}. With fast enough triggers on its lateral {{icon/star}}s, multiple temporary {{icon/empower}} could overlap and cause a large amount of additional damage, especially if the player has multiple weapons.

[[Carrot Goobert]] is a component of the [[Rainbow Goobert Megasludge Alphapuddle]], also requiring the [[Light Goobert]], [[Steel Goobert]], and [[Blood Goobert]]. This is a very difficult craft and thankfully the end-product is undeniably very powerful.
